{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12953","headline":"观海 · 独孤及","name":"观海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北登渤澥岛，廻首秦东门。\n谁尸造物功，凿此天池源。\n澒洞吞百谷，周流无四垠。\n廓然混茫际，望见天地根。\n白日自中吐，扶桑如可扪。\n超遥蓬莱峰，想像金台存。\n秦帝昔经此，登临冀飞翻。\n扬旌百神会，望日羣山奔。\n徐福竟何成，羡门徒空言。\n唯见石桥足，千年潮水痕。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"独孤及","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12953.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12953","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}